com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBaqLfZuRQoL-TxsK9moK0Bsf3bpwBtJ5QT3g-h-y7Zdw&oe=6A4CFA2B"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "0ff07622-58b0-477f-8274-588ca5313de9 (1) (1) (3).png", "id": "1570662874122857", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824303_1570662877456190_3653996715888255952_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_c1KShyE-m0Q7kNvwFJmuFc&_nc_oc=AdodZZl0tFBMxWWQz0-ApW_fOi8Q3jp23MGauDCx_3sAbJ3J8Rcs_9ilaYG66-3VLvg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBoTIdsGLAbTLmKcq-3KMdUILif2s_59mgJgO5B1Uy_JA&oe=6A4D0759"}, "display_name": "BackspinVR: Snooker & Pool", "keywords": ["snooker", "pool", "billiards", "multiplayer", "simulation"], "long_description": "# BackspinVR\n\nStep up to a dedicated VR cue-sports table built on **geometrically accurate layouts**, **spin-true cue ball physics**, realistic throw, and believable table roll. Every shot reacts the way it should.\n\n**Real cue-sports variants** \u2013 Play full-size snooker, American & English 8-ball, Chinese 8-ball, and American 9-ball, each on layouts tuned to real dimensions and pocket geometry.  \n{1841114623165523}\n\n**Natural cue handling** \u2013 Learn fast with an intuitive aim-lock-strike mechanic, accurate bridge-hand support, and a toggleable rest and spider for awkward reach shots. A short in-table tutorial gets you started, and the free-play sandbox lets you develop your stroke.  \n{922653590925418}\n\n**Choose how you play** \u2013 Practice alone in Sandbox, take on challenging AI opponents, or jump online with random matchmaking or private room codes. Meta Avatars, spatial audio, and smooth networking make every frame feel shared. Optional aim-guides help beginners build consistency without affecting the underlying physics.  \n{1566460714352221}\n\n### **FAQ**\n\n**Does it include full-size snooker?**  \nYes \u2014 you can play full-size snooker or 3/4 size, along with American & English 8-ball, Chinese 8-ball, and 9-ball.\n\n**Do I need a real table or cue?**  \nNo \u2014 everything is handled virtually. You aim with controllers or hands, lock your shot, and let the cue and rests track naturally on the virtual cloth.\n\n**Can I play solo and online?**  \nYes \u2014 practice in Sandbox, face AI, or compete online through random matchmaking or private room codes.\n", "short_description": "Master realistic cue sports in VR. Play snooker, American & English 8-ball, Chinese 8-ball, and 9-ball with spin-true physics and precise mechanics. Practice solo, challenge AI opponents, or compete online in matchmaking or private rooms."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://portuslabs.dev/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Portus Labs", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://portuslabs.dev/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2776542286000603"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER", "SINGLE_USER"], "id": "24032826353043954"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 5, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1674234943801397"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1184794746996741"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1466611741715200"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "685232404555690"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1285302443634158"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1285302443634158"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1786726800, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1674234943801397"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "27484559417870613", "version": "0.2.7"}, "id": "1284567633335251", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "24032826349710621", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "27484559417870613"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1284567633335251"}]}, "change_log": "- Made real cue alignment work regardless of handedness setting. It is now based off which controller you press Y/B on when lining up with the ghost cue.\n\n- Added an \u2018on the fly adjustment\u2019 button into the cue settings which allows tweaking of the virtual cue position during gameplay.\n\n- Fixed the the fine tune controls sometimes inverting, and made the fine tuning overall more consistent. Bumped up the roll increment as before it was near invisible.\n\n- Smoothed out edge cases around the real cue alignment scenario orientation, and around the initial table set up getting stuck.", "created_date": 1782749064, "id": "27484559417870613", "version": "0.2.7", "version_code": 62, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "24032826349710621", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "27484559417870613"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1284567633335251"}]}, "change_log": "**Real Cue Mode**\n\n\n- Added new Real Cue mode + set up scenario.\n\n- Added one-handed table movement and rotation controls while using a real cue.\n\n- Optional translucent passthrough surface overlay for easier real-world alignment.\n\n**Cueing & Physics**\n\n\n- Cue now has full physical collisions with cushions, table surfaces, and balls across all cueing modes.\n\n- Added optional High Bridge mode for arcade/realism cueing (toggle by pressing either thumbstick).\n\n- Physics tuning, particularly around cue ball spin:\n    - Easier to apply backspin.\n    - Improved cushion edge cases.\n    - Various other minor refinements.\n\n**Equipment & Visuals**\n\n\n- Added an Equipment section to Settings.\n\n- Added visual customisation options including tournament ball sets and various cloth colours.\n\n- Refreshed various UI visuals and interactions.\n\n**Gameplay**\n\n\n- Added Redo Shot functionality. After undoing a completed shot, pressing Undo again will restore it.\n\n    - Note: only available once the table has fully settled.\n\n- Tuned pool AI behaviour to be less chaotic and more measured.\n\n\n**General**\n\n\n- Various minor visual improvements, tweaks and fixes.", "created_date": 1782658992, "id": "27472717432388145", "version": "0.2.6", "version_code": 61, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "24032826349710621", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "27484559417870613"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1782654049, "id": "27471957099130845", "version": "0.2.6", "version_code": 60, "release_status": "PENDING", "status": "DRAFT", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "24032826349710621", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "27484559417870613"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1284567633335251"}]}, "change_log": "New Networking Setup\n-Improved performance, especially when playing on Quest 2 or when the host is using Quest 2.\n\n-Removed a source of shot rejections which could manifest as unusual cue ball behaviour (for example, bouncing unexpectedly off object balls).\n\n-Fixed remote cue presentation so opponents\u2019 cueing is now visually accurate (for example, no more apparent side spin).\n\n-New cross-region networking support.\n\nGeneral bug fixes and tweaks\n-Reduced spin decay for the snooker cue ball only.\n\n-Reduced side spin loss after cushion collisions for the snooker cue ball only.\n\n-Fixed an issue where snooker scores could sometimes carry over after resetting in sandbox mode.\n\n-Various other minor performance optimisations, tweaks and fixes.", "created_date": 1779702510, "id": "27044429811883578", "version": "0.2.5", "version_code": 59, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "24032826349710621", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "27484559417870613"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1284567633335251"}]}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1779624138, "id": "27034877596172133", "version": "0.2.5", "version_code": 58, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}]}}, "viewer": {"user": null}}}